&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with software development lifecycle (SDLC) and Agile methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of software CM principles and QA methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, communication, and teamwork skills&lt;/li&gt;
