&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to organize, manage, market and grow an office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated PC and communication skills, especially in regard to networking with the community and representing our organization to various groups and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;Ambition to grow and advance beyond current position and responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
