&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a comprehensive benefits plan that includes the following: Paid holidays, vacation and sick leave, vision, dental and medical health plans, employer paid life insurance, 401k with company match, direct deposit and employee assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
