sggc-avepoint:greenhouse:6866941.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;90&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;88&quot;&gt;Beyond Secure.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;787&quot;&gt;AvePoint is the global leader in data security, governance, and resilience, going beyond traditional solutions to ensure a robust data foundation and enable organizations everywhere to collaborate with confidence. Over 25,000 customers worldwide rely on the AvePoint Confidence Platform to prepare, secure, and optimize their critical data across Microsoft, Google, Salesforce, and other collaboration environments. AvePoint’s global channel partner program includes approximately 5,000 managed service providers, value-added resellers, and systems integrators, with our solutions available in more than 100 cloud marketplaces. To learn more, visit &lt;a class=&quot;&quot; href=&quot;http://www.avepoint.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;784&quot;&gt;www.avepoint.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1155&quot; data-end=&quot;1188&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1186&quot;&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position offers you the opportunity to work with public agency IT teams of Singapore to support their IT digitization strategy and roadmap. If you are driven by challenges and passionate about working with cutting-edge IT technology, come chat with us to see if this role is a good fit for your career aspirations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1155&quot; data-end=&quot;1188&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1186&quot;&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working within an agency as part of its IT project team, which includes the Product/Project Manager, Solution Architect, and, where applicable, a Technical Services Consultant. Together, you will deliver ICT capabilities to support Singapore’s vision of a Smart Nation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look for people who value agility, passion, and teamwork; those who can bring fresh ideas to the table and want the opportunity to learn, grow, and expand their careers. Bring your aptitude and build upon what you do best for our customers, partners, team, and you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1765&quot; data-end=&quot;1803&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1769&quot; data-end=&quot;1801&quot;&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Skills Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1805&quot; data-end=&quot;1837&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1810&quot; data-end=&quot;1825&quot;&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 3-7years&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1839&quot; data-end=&quot;1871&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1844&quot; data-end=&quot;1869&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;full-stack web applications &lt;/strong&gt;using:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend&lt;/strong&gt;: React, JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5/CSS3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend&lt;/strong&gt;: Java with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Spring Boot&lt;/strong&gt;, microservices, and RESTful APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;SQL Server/Azure SQL Database &lt;/strong&gt;for relational data, adapting to other databases (NoSQL, etc.) as project needs dictate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;(DevOps) and implement&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;secure coding practices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and manage cloud-native solutions (&lt;strong&gt;AWS Lambda, S3, Docker&lt;/strong&gt;) and containerized applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure code quality through&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;automated testing&lt;/strong&gt;(Selenium, Mocha, Karma) and peer reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Product Managers, QA, and UI/UX teams &lt;/strong&gt;in Agile/SCRUM environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers and contribute to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;technical roadmaps &lt;/strong&gt;and architecture decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education:&amp;nbsp;Bachelor&#39;s&amp;nbsp;degree&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are looking for an opportunity to grow your career while working on meaningful projects, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

